    {"id":"wa-t","type":"text","x":973,"y":170,"width":354,"height":180,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7f1d1d","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b5","roundness":null,"seed":208,"version":1,"versionNonce":208,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1780000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"BLOQUEANTE 3 — WHATSAPP / KAPSO\n\n• Aprobación de Mizar para publicar Flow\n• Webhook público + KAPSO_WEBHOOK_SECRET\n• Plantillas Meta: solicitante y aprobadores\n• Plan Kapso, tarifas Meta y responsable\n• Prueba E2E Flow → requisición","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"BLOQUEANTE 3 — WHATSAPP / KAPSO\n\n• Aprobación de Mizar para publicar Flow\n• Webhook público + KAPSO_WEBHOOK_SECRET\n• Plantillas Meta: solicitante y aprobadores\n• Plan Kapso, tarifas Meta y responsable\n• Prueba E2E Flow → requisición","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},

